---@field dimensionValue aws.marketplace_agreement.ZeroValueInteger The number of units of the dimension the acceptor has purchased.

---@alias aws.marketplace_agreement.DimensionList aws.marketplace_agreement.Dimension[]

---Includes the list of references to legal resources proposed by the proposer to the acceptor. Each DocumentItem refers to an individual reference.
---@class aws.marketplace_agreement.DocumentItem
---@field type? aws.marketplace_agreement.BoundedString Category of the document. Document types include:
---@field url? aws.marketplace_agreement.BoundedString A URL to the legal document for buyers to read. Required when Type is CustomEula.
---@field version? aws.marketplace_agreement.BoundedString Version of standard contracts provided by AWS Marketplace. Required when Type is StandardEula or StandardDsa.

---@alias aws.marketplace_agreement.DocumentList aws.marketplace_agreement.DocumentItem[]

---The behavior of an agreement when it reaches its end date. For example, whether the agreement renews, and if it doesn't, the reason why.
