---@field renewalSummary? aws.marketplace_agreement.RenewalSummary The details of the renewal that applies at the end date of the agreement. This field is present when Type is RENEW. It is also present when ReasonCode is PROPOSER_RENEW_OPTED_OUT or ACCEPTOR_RENEW_OPTED_OUT. In those cases, it identifies the offer that the agreement would otherwise have renewed from. The field is null in all other cases.

---@alias aws.marketplace_agreement.EndTimeBehaviorReasonCode "PROPOSER_RENEW_OPTED_OUT"|"ACCEPTOR_RENEW_OPTED_OUT"|"NO_RENEWAL_TERM"|"RENEWAL_LIMIT_EXHAUSTED"

---@alias aws.marketplace_agreement.EndTimeBehaviorType "RENEW"|"REPLACE"|"EXPIRE"

