---@field estimatedTaxes? aws.marketplace_agreement.EstimatedTaxes Provides an aggregated view of estimated tax information for this specific charge.

---@alias aws.marketplace_agreement.ExpectedChargeList aws.marketplace_agreement.ExpectedCharge[]

