---@field currencyCode? aws.marketplace_agreement.CurrencyCode Defines the currency for the prices mentioned in the term.
---@field schedule? aws.marketplace_agreement.ScheduleList List of the payment schedule where each element defines one installment of payment. It contains the information necessary for calculating the price.

---Defines the payment schedule that is applied to the renewed agreement.
---@class aws.marketplace_agreement.PaymentScheduleTermTemplate
